<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave B — Acklay creature port, executing the owner's
  ruling (STARWARS_DONOR_SUNSET_1, question card 2026-09-02): "Wampa and Acklay:
  WIRE THEM IN — port both and give them real cast slots ... honoring the original
  adoption intent that never landed." Acklay was Tier C in the 2026-09-02
  dependency census (no functional dependency — cited in required_mods.md as an
  adoption reason but never actually cast). "Wherever fits" per the ruling: cast
  into Scarlands at a low commonality (0.05) — a savage, armored arena predator
  fits the biome's war-wreckage/weapon-descendant register better than Ash'karr's
  other biomes, and Scarlands already hosts several rare apex creatures at similar
  weights.

  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `Acklay` ThingDef/PawnKindDef pair,
  renamed under the RSW_ tier prefix. Custom body (RSW_Acklay,
  RSW_MlieWaveB_Bodies.xml — an armored arthropod build: Shell/Elytra/InsectLeg/
  InsectHead, the donor's own theming for a crustacean-like predator), custom
  body-part-groups (RSW_SWLeftLegClawAttackTool/RSW_SWRightLegClawAttackTool,
  RSW_MlieWaveB_BodyParts.xml), the Odyssey rampage ability (RSW_SW_Rampage,
  RSW_MlieWaveB_Abilities.xml), eggs/leather/meat/trophy (RSW_EggAcklay{,Un}
  Fertilized, RSW_Leather_Crustapod, RSW_Crustapod_Meat, RSW_AcklayClaw,
  RSW_MlieWaveB_Resources.xml), sounds (RSW_Pawn_Acklay_*, already absorbed).
  texPaths unchanged text (swanimals/Acklay/... — the alternate-graphics palette of
  5 colour variants, each with its own swimming set, ported along with the base).
-->
<Defs>
<ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
